  "flow": "Pieces of an asset with a water_flow socket carry flow = {direction (unit, Roblox X/Z), speed (studs/s), socket}. To animate, use a Texture (Face Top, StudsPerTileU/V = tile_studs) on the piece instead of TextureID and move OffsetStudsU/V along direction * speed each frame."
